    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hentai Cleopatra</i> is an exciting game that combines puzzles, an intriguing storyline, and a seductive atmosphere inspired by the legendary queen of Egypt. You will immerse yourself in the world of ancient Egypt, where power, passion, and mysteries intertwine into a single story. The main heroine of the game is the charming <strong>Cleopatra</strong>\u2014a wise, powerful, and incredibly attractive queen who uses both her intelligence and natural beauty to rule her kingdom and captivate the hearts of the most influential men.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519880/extras/900a123a8e8754d79f390c3aa288d9fa.poster.avif?t=1745997784\" width=640 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519880/extras/900a123a8e8754d79f390c3aa288d9fa.webm?t=1745997784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519880/extras/900a123a8e8754d79f390c3aa288d9fa.mp4?t=1745997784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, her greatest weapon is not only political intrigue and diplomacy but also her ability to enchant, seduce, and manipulate her enemies, creating a unique atmosphere of power and desire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Easy</i> - for those who want to enjoy the story and puzzles without excessive challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Normal</i> - a perfect balance between challenges and an engaging storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hard</i> - for players seeking serious intellectual challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 levels, each revealing new secrets of Cleopatra;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 achievements for true conquerors;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gallery with the hottest scenes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various difficulty levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, oriental music that transports you to the age of the pharaohs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, unlock sensual scenes, and dive into the legend of <i>Hentai Cleopatra\u00a0</i>- a game that enchants, seduces, and leaves unforgettable impressions.</p>",
